P('meta-appeal-links-india','Meta Appeal Links for India (2026): Instagram, Facebook, Ads, Grievance','Meta appeal links India','Official Meta appeal links for Instagram, Facebook and ad accounts in India, plus the IT Rules grievance route and cybercrime reporting. Checked November 2026.','Meta appeal links for India','<strong>In India, Instagram and Facebook appeals start from the notice at login or Account Status.</strong> Ad accounts are reviewed in Business Support Home. India adds a grievance route under the IT Rules 2021, and hacks or fraud can be reported at cybercrime.gov.in or 1930. Meta makes the final decision.',[('ig','Instagram',IG[:4]),('fb','Facebook',FB[:4]),('ads','Ad accounts',ADS[:3])],[EQ,('Is there a Meta phone number in India?','Meta does not offer a phone line for account appeals.'),('What is the Grievance Appellate Committee?','A government body under the IT Rules 2021 that hears appeals against platform grievance decisions.')]),
P('instagram-hacked-india-what-to-do','Instagram Hacked in India: What to Do (2026)','Instagram hacked India','Your Instagram was hacked and you are in India. instagram.com/hacked, the video selfie, and reporting to cybercrime.gov.in or 1930.','Instagram hacked in India: what to do','<strong>If your Instagram was hacked in India, start at instagram.com/hacked on your usual phone.</strong> Follow the email, phone or video selfie checks. If money was asked from your followers or you lost money, report at cybercrime.gov.in or call 1930. Instagram makes the final decision.',[('ig','Instagram',[IG[1],IG[0],IG[2]])],[('Should I file a police complaint?','If money or threats are involved, report at cybercrime.gov.in or call 1930.'),('The hacker changed my email and number. Can I still recover?','Often, through instagram.com/hacked and a video selfie.')]),
P('meta-ad-account-disabled-india','Meta Ad Account Disabled in India (2026): What to Do','Ad account disabled India','A Meta ad account was disabled in India. Business Support Home, payment issues with Indian cards and UPI, and the grievance route.','Meta ad account disabled in India','<strong>A disabled Meta ad account in India is reviewed in Business Support Home.</strong> Check payment failures first, since declined Indian cards or RBI auto-debit mandates often trigger holds. Then request one review as an admin. A grievance route exists under the IT Rules 2021. Meta makes the final decision.',[('ads','Ads',[AQ]+ADS[:3])],[('My Indian card keeps getting declined on Meta. Why?','RBI rules on recurring payments mean some cards need an e-mandate or OTP. Ask your bank, or use another payment method Meta offers.'),('Who should request the review?','An admin of the ad account, from their own profile.')]),
